    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... the noise is getting louder. It makes me wonder if there's any real difference between existing and not existing, if the outcome is the same eventually anyway. If the end is inevitable, why does the struggle matter so much? Is there not some level of wisdom in making that choice on one's own terms?",
